        {
          "name": "Run it in steps where the pass is new to a machine",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:12c450b980e283702388a003e6cdfeadd23e62abba83ed862354819cef582ba0",
          "description": "plan_only describes every motion and sends nothing; step=N sends one motion, says what it left armed, and holds the cool-down until the last step. A wipe that presses or crosses the plate asks for plate_clear on every call: a person's word, never inferred. Where a model's wipe has not yet been run on a real machine, Kiln says so and runs it in steps only",
